/**
 * The Amelia tables the Amelia ops read and write (issue #499), for tests
 * that exercise them without Amelia installed in the shared test core.
 *
 * Copied from the tables Amelia Lite 2.4.11 creates on activation (SHOW
 * CREATE TABLE on a live install), with the plain indexes left out; the
 * primary and unique keys stay, since the restore depends on them.
 *
 * DDL commits implicitly, so callers create the tables in
 * wpSetUpBeforeClass() and drop them in wpTearDownAfterClass(), outside the
 * per-test transaction. Rows written inside a test still roll back with the
 * test's transaction.
 */

